{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411070","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1241107001:1":{"text":"Would you really turn down a job at the workshop? I could use an assistant!","source_cn":"你这小子，真不打算来百炼工坊干活？我正缺个助手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5094B84389CC6BA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241107002:1":{"text":"Thanks, Hugin. It's not that I don't appreciate the offer, but I'm happy with my life as it is.","source_cn":"谢了，呼金老兄。不是我不领你的情，只不过是现在的生活比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB013F18E024AFA6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241107003:1":{"text":"I can't stand the Carmine Whispers' strict rules, not to mention the endless labor.","source_cn":"我可受不了血薇帮那些破规矩。嗯，还有无穷无尽的体力活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD9796BFA24F7E9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241107004:1":{"text":"Okay, okay, no more excuses. In the end, it's all about the money!","source_cn":"行了行了，别找那么多借口。说来说去，最后还不是为了钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8C963B4E913882F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241107005:1":{"text":"Ha, it's a demanding life, what can you do?","source_cn":"哈，生活所迫，没办法啊。","status"